# Web IDL exceptions

Reserved for the Exceptions section of the pinned Web IDL source: the
simple exception kinds (`TypeError`, `RangeError`, and the rest), the
`DOMException` names table, and the "throw" and "create" operations, as
the first-order exception universe that `Whatwg.Streams.Boundary.Exception`
and the URL boundary will be restated over. Strategy question RS-Q3 in
`docs/REIFICATION-STRATEGY.md` asks whether these are Stratum V data or need
a signature; that is decided when the first packet is frozen.
